Interoperability notice
-----------------------
Kara Download Manager and the Kara DM browser extension speak the same local WebSocket protocol as the
Neat Download Manager desktop application, so that either app works with either browser extension. The protocol
was documented from observable behaviour for interoperability. No code, binaries or assets from Neat Download
Manager are used or distributed. "Neat Download Manager" is a product of its respective owner; this project is
not affiliated with, sponsored or endorsed by it.

Third-party software
--------------------
Binary releases bundle separately licensed programs and libraries (aria2, GTK, GLib, libadwaita, yt-dlp, and
ffmpeg in the Flatpak). They are listed with their licenses and source locations in THIRD-PARTY.md.
